  "summary": "Magento Improper Authorization leading to security feature bypass",
  "description": "Magento versions 2.4.8, 2.4.7-p5, 2.4.6-p10, 2.4.5-p12, 2.4.4-p13 and earlier are affected by an Improper Authorization vulnerability that could result in a Security feature bypass. An attacker could leverage this vulnerability to bypass security measures and gain unauthorized access leading to a limited impact to confidentiality and a high impact to integrity. Exploitation of this issue does not require user interaction.",
